OL,3,GNEWSAWill #23m scheme cut traffic jams
OL,4,Aand rat-running?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA multi-million pound scheme aimed at
OL,7,Feasing city centre traffic congestion
OL,8,Fdoes not go far enough, according to
OL,9,Fresidents.
OL,11,FPeople living in Salisbury, Wiltshire,
OL,12,Fare being asked to share their thoughts
OL,13,Fon the next stage of a plan to improve
OL,14,Fthe busy A36.
OL,16,FNational Highways wants to spend #23m
OL,17,Fon widening the road and upgrading
OL,18,Fageing traffic signals from 2029-30 if
OL,19,Fthe funding is approved.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
