OL,3,GNEWSAWill #23m scheme cut traffic jams
OL,4,Aand rat-running?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut resident Paul Whitelegg, who does
OL,7,Fnot think it will solve the issue of
OL,8,Frat-running in nearby streets, said:
OL,9,F"Ultimately, Salisbury needs a proper
OL,10,Fbypass. This won't make a difference."
